  "rationale": "The batch repeatedly continues noun phrases with a noun after a determiner or adjective. The representative prefix ends in “the” and its gold noun receives almost no probability, while several competing nouns are strongly weighted by unrelated contextual rules. Add a moderate noun-production rule to frequent batch noun roots when the visible prefix ends in a determiner or adjective. This transfers across names and noun choices without asserting which noun must follow. It can over-weight nouns after adjectives in contexts where an adjective is not a modifier, and lexical choice remains uncertain; replay should check those tradeoffs.",
